        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballest of Them All is a</strong> <strong>physics ball game</strong> that rewards creative routes and clean movement.  Beat your personal best with smarter routes, better jumps, and smoother landings—then beat everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/076f78e64b03b4ad51b3884a0c7d1641.poster.avif?t=1788878009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/076f78e64b03b4ad51b3884a0c7d1641.webm?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/076f78e64b03b4ad51b3884a0c7d1641.mp4?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPETE ON GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your PB to refine your run, or study faster players’ ghosts to learn their routes and beat their times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/7e6f9b758de3d710004f457f7f948b46.poster.avif?t=1788878009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/7e6f9b758de3d710004f457f7f948b46.webm?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/7e6f9b758de3d710004f457f7f948b46.mp4?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE TOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 floors of Ballest's toughest tricks and challenges, no checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/6874bb89068e78cf531e25371ec8b2fe.poster.avif?t=1788878009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/6874bb89068e78cf531e25371ec8b2fe.webm?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/6874bb89068e78cf531e25371ec8b2fe.mp4?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE THROUGH 150+ WORKSHOP TRACKS OR BUILD YOUR OWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse quick sprints, technical challenges, trick courses, and strange experiments in the Hub. Use the built-in Track Editor to create your own and share it in-game or through Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/d17a279c00219c1641f23b4da57a7bfb.poster.avif?t=1788878009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/d17a279c00219c1641f23b4da57a7bfb.webm?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/d17a279c00219c1641f23b4da57a7bfb.mp4?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style with hats, skins, and goal explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/822f5813f1dc455106067a8ac2f68367.poster.avif?t=1788878009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/822f5813f1dc455106067a8ac2f68367.webm?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/822f5813f1dc455106067a8ac2f68367.mp4?t=1788878009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339810/extras/4ebd7352ba60771f81d11843e2de327d.avif?t=1788878009\" width=750 height=802 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
